WEBVTT

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:52.910
Amazing...

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:54.040
What is?

00:00:55.780 --> 00:00:58.190
The moon. Doesn't it look really big?

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:00.350
That's just your imagination.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:03.550
Whoa! You made a ton of lunches again?

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:07.330
More and more people keep 
asking me to make them one...

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:10.680
Maybe I'm actually a genius chef?

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:14.750
They're just using you to 
get out of paying for lunch.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:15.800
Aw, c'mon...

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.610
I mean, your lunches aren't even that good.

00:01:19.610 --> 00:01:21.240
You don't mince words...

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:22.880
What?

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:25.300
I left one at school!

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:26.850
A lunch?

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:44.310
Let's see...

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:45.660
There it is!

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:51.460
Smells like it's still okay.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:31.000
<b>GRANBELM</b>

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:31.000
The Two Princeps

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.010
Ow...

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.390
What just...

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.970
Wh-What's that?!

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.730
Rosa. Suishou.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:28.670
<i>Yes?</i>

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.330
There is someone inside.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.310
<i>Is it a new mage?</i>

00:04:33.310 --> 00:04:35.370
You do not need to ask questions!

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.280
Do you still fail to comprehend 
your own position?!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.590
<i>Yes, ma'am.</i>

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.900
Ha! You got in trouble!

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.220
Shut up!

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.170
Mistress, are you sure you'll 
be all right over there?

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:52.870
I can handle this myself.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.160
Let me warn you...

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:08.700
You cannot defeat me.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.430
How dare you speak to me that way...

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:17.490
under these circumstances?!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:43.280
You filthy stray cat!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.470
Take this!

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:20.650
You truly believe you can escape?!

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:26.860
She vanished?!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:42.630
Ernesta!

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:47.590
What is this?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:50.050
What is it? What, what, what?!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:52.180
Found you!

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:57.720
What's going on?!

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.440
Why don't I have any signal?!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.460
This is why I asked for a new phone!

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.000
Is this a dream?

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.120
It's all a dream... A dream,
 a dream, a dream, a dream...

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.420
Just a dream...

00:07:24.180 --> 00:07:26.880
Nope, definitely not!

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:29.300
Why are you running around unprotected?

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.510
Where is your ARMANOX?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:32.970
<i>You'll get in trouble for 
asking questions again!</i>

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.010
Hello?!

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:43.510
<i>Hello? Who are you?</i>

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:46.030
You're asking me? Who are <i>you</i>?!

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.610
Which mage are you?

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.990
<i>Mage? What are you talking about?!</i>

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:54.950
Listen, I'm in trouble! I don't know 
if there's a war going on or what,

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:56.280
but there's this huge robot...

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:01.120
Forget it! I don't know who you 
are, but please call the police—

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.370
A robot?

00:08:03.510 --> 00:08:04.590
<i>What?</i>

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:06.220
I'll be there soon.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:08.170
Try to avoid capture until then.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.770
<i>Seriously, call the police!</i>

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.470
There are no police.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.050
She's close...

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:29.020
A decoy?!

00:08:41.110 --> 00:08:42.060
Where is she?

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.330
Too slow!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:46.540
I've already constructed my spell!

00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.720
Now die!

00:09:04.430 --> 00:09:05.640
The same trick...

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.630
won't work this time!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.570
You've improved quite a bit.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:22.830
Don't you condescend to me!

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:27.970
My ARMANOX has a higher maximum 
magical power level than yours!

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:32.010
If it comes down to a contest of strength 
with no time to construct spells...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.930
Do you realize how much time passed 
while you were constructing your spell?!

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:44.760
I told you...

00:09:44.760 --> 00:09:46.060
you can't beat me!

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.900
That's how it goes

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:10.490
when you're weak and think you're a great
mage based on your bloodline alone.

00:10:10.490 --> 00:10:12.500
She's gonna hear you.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.920
It even looks different outside...

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:27.990
What's happening?

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:40.740
Whatever it is, I gotta run!

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.380
There you are!

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.100
Ow!

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.720
What are you doing?!

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.170
Honestly...

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.650
Anna has fled.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:04.260
Are you going to fight me?

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.780
Don't you mock me!

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.710
I'm a qualified mage,
and I'm in this battle, too!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:11.270
And away I go!

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:14.590
That idiot!

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.170
<i>We did it!</i>

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.290
<i>Don't joke around.</i>

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.530
<i>We clearly missed.</i>

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:43.430
What are you two doing?!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.400
I thought we finally hit, and I see this?!

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.850
<i>You're right...</i>

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:21.890
What is that?

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.680
It's a lunch box...

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.180
A lunch box? Why?

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:29.800
Well...

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:36.100
I've never seen anyone 
eat with so much gusto.

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:37.930
Is it good?

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:40.310
No, it just tastes ordinary.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:42.870
You don't mince words...

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:46.110
Hey, what is this place?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.640
As I believe you've realized,

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.200
this is not the world in which we live.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.850
I thought so!

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:56.680
Does that mean we've been 
reborn in a p-parallel world?!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:56.680
It does not.

00:12:57.520 --> 00:13:00.120
This is a type of illusionary world.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.650
It was created by Magiaconatus.

00:13:03.150 --> 00:13:05.390
Magia...conatus?

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:08.970
There's no need to worry.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:11.560
We'll return to our own world soon.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.990
Really?

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:16.790
More importantly, which 
mage's descendant are you?

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:18.800
Mage?

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:20.440
Where is your ARMANOX?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:21.530
Um...

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:23.310
What is this?

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.990
A pickled plum.

00:13:31.610 --> 00:13:32.750
What's the matter?

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:36.090
Wh-What is this thing?!

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.590
You're from another country, aren't you?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:42.520
How can you tell?

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:43.950
What's your name?

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.550
Shingetsu.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:51.640
Shingetsu Ernesta Fukami.

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.640
Shingetsu...

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:57.640
Wow! My name's Mangetsu!

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.290
Kohinata Mangetsu!

00:14:01.260 --> 00:14:02.580
Mangetsu?

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:06.380
We're both named after the moon!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:23.170
I'll never catch up with
my current recovery rate!

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.750
GRANBELM?

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:34.040
Yes. It's a battle held every month 
on the night of the full moon

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:36.610
until only one is left standing,

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:40.940
to determine who is the one 
true mage, the Princeps.

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:47.190
You look as though you didn't 
understand a word of that.

00:14:47.190 --> 00:14:49.980
That's because I <i>didn't</i> 
understand a word of it!

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:52.600
I will explain.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.180
Okay!

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:56.440
Long ago,

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.470
magic was abundant in our world.

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.330
It was?!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.340
We have to start that far back?

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.360
In ancient times, magical power 
enriched the lives of all people,

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:14.520
and spells became widespread 
as techniques for utilizing it.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:19.960
However, people eventually 
began to use it for war,

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:25.170
causing the destruction of nature 
and threatening life itself.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.690
Then, seven sages who held the greatest 
magical power in all the world

00:15:31.690 --> 00:15:37.260
gave their own lives to seal all
 the magical power filling the world,

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.720
ridding us of all magic.

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.140
This happened nearly a thousand years ago.

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.990
Magic really existed?

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:50.260
That seal is Magiaconatus.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:56.330
In other words, all the magic that once 
filled the world is contained within it.

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:17.030
Darn it... Who the heck 
fired from so far awa—

00:16:19.340 --> 00:16:20.160
Ernesta!

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:22.450
Get out of here, now!

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:26.500
She's damaged.

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.380
Pennies from heaven!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:30.300
Suishou! Suishou!

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:32.760
That idiot!

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.800
Of all the times...

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:37.530
Go!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.550
Run! Hurry!

00:16:52.920 --> 00:16:55.200
I'm going to beat you,

00:16:55.200 --> 00:16:58.200
and make her—make that stupid Anna—

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:00.910
bow down to me!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.320
<i>My heart is pounding...</i>

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:24.320
What? What is this?

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:39.910
What?

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:49.710
What? What?!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:50.900
What?!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:51.520
What's that?

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:07.230
A new ARMANOX...

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.160
<i>Shingetsu-chan...</i>

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.160
Mangetsu?

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:12.590
I'm inside this thing... What do I do?

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:13.630
<i>Can you move it?</i>

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.980
How am I supposed to understand this?!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.290
It can't move that well?

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.510
When two Sundays come together!

00:19:29.480 --> 00:19:31.480
Go, my Windlings!

00:19:33.160 --> 00:19:35.010
What?! Something's coming!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.580
<i>Envision it!</i>

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.250
Huh?!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.750
<i>That big doll is an ARMANOX.</i>

00:19:39.750 --> 00:19:42.150
<i>It's your own heart, given shape!</i>

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:44.620
My heart?

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.830
<i>It is... you, yourself.</i>

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:53.250
<i>Think hard about how you 
want it to move and fight.</i>

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:55.170
<i>You have to envision it!</i>

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.290
Envision it?

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.800
Envision... Envision...

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:04.190
Envision it. Envision it.

00:20:05.960 --> 00:20:08.430
Envision it! Envision it! Envision it!

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:12.520
Go! Slice it apart!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.790
Envision it! Envision it!

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:18.560
Envision it! Envision it! Envision it!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.300
Envision it! Envision it!

00:20:20.300 --> 00:20:21.530
Envision it!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:30.540
That's...

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:38.920
How dare you destroy...

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:41.320
my Windlings?!

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:43.210
Damn you!

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:47.180
Envision it! Envision it!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:49.470
Let's go, CREST ANTHURIUM!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:54.020
Go!

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:03.720
Block it!

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:06.820
What?!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:29.550
What is this?!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.340
Huh?! No way!

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:58.590
It's... over?

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.430
What now?!

00:22:11.340 --> 00:22:12.970
What... is this?

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:59.750
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:57.960 --> 00:24:00.960
<i>When Mangetsu returned to the real world,</i>

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.700
<i>awaiting her was the beautiful 
story told by Shingetsu</i>

00:24:04.700 --> 00:24:08.110
<i>of the birth of the mages and the magical 
power concealed within the world.</i>

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:11.630
<i>Shocked upon learning the truth of her world,</i>

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:14.010
<i>Mangetsu then made a decision.</i>

00:24:14.940 --> 00:24:16.460
<i>Next time on </i>GRANBELM<i>,</i>

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.400
<i>"So That I Can Stay Here."</i>

00:24:16.930 --> 00:24:19.720
<b>So That I Can Stay Here</b>

00:24:20.000 --> 00:24:23.610
<i>It is a power that can drive 
fate itself into disorder...</i>

00:24:27.020 --> 00:24:30.030
<b>Look forward to the next episode!</b>
